//! ## Workspace Member Permissions
//!
//! All project-scoped novel endpoints require **workspace member access**:
//!
//! - **Read operations** (GET): Requires workspace membership (owner/admin/member role)
//! - **Write operations** (POST/PATCH/DELETE): Requires workspace membership + write permission
//!
//! ### Permission Model
//!
//! 1. **Workspace Role Check**: User must be a member of the project's workspace (owner/admin/member)
//! 2. **Project ACL Check** (if enabled):
//!    - If project has explicit ACL enabled: requires `editor` or `viewer` role
//!    - If project ACL disabled: all workspace members have access
//! 3. **Write Permission**: Workspace owner/admin, project owner, or editor role (if ACL enabled)
//!
//! ### Error Responses
//!
//! - **403 Forbidden**: "not a member of project workspace" - user is not in the project's workspace
//! - **403 Forbidden**: "project requires explicit viewer or editor access" - project has ACL enabled but user lacks role
